WEBVTT

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:29.040
Yes, you've made a full recovery.

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:30.660
You're well enough to go to school.

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:32.000
Really?!

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.500
Now I can get back to my training!

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:36.750
Training? What sort of training?

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:38.290
The clone technique!

00:00:38.290 --> 00:00:39.660
Watch this!

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:42.080
Ninjutsu, eh?

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:46.290
Dr. Jakurai's just the
greatest, don't you think?

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:50.700
--He's so kind to everyone,
from the young to the old.
--Thanks, doctor! See ya!

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:57.160
Dr. Jinguji, Dr. Jinguji, please report
to the Orthopedic Department.

00:00:57.160 --> 00:01:02.660
Dr. Jinguji, Dr. Jinguji, please report
to the Gastroenterology Department.

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:05.790
Perhaps I should study ninjutsu as well...

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:08.500
Well, well, if it isn't Dr. Jakurai.

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:10.250
You're quite a popular guy.

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:13.080
Captain Degarashi and Detective Irihatoma.

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:14.250
What seems to be the problem?

00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:15.950
We're just making our rounds.

00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:19.000
Not even the hospitals are safe these days.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:21.910
Speaking of which, the incident
that took place in this hospital recently?

00:01:21.910 --> 00:01:24.580
I hear that you're the one
who resolved it, Doctor.

00:01:24.580 --> 00:01:27.330
It was just a coincidence.

00:01:27.330 --> 00:01:29.700
Oh, well.

00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:33.540
I'll expose you one of these days.

00:01:33.540 --> 00:01:35.000
My apologies.

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:38.000
The captain suspects
that you're no ordinary doctor

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:41.410
and that there's got to be more
to you than meets the eye.

00:01:41.410 --> 00:01:43.080
More to me than meets the eye?

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:44.830
But there's no reason to think that, is there?

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:47.200
I'm a big fan of Matenro.

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:48.700
I wish you guys the best of luck!

00:01:48.700 --> 00:01:50.950
Captain, wait for me!

00:01:55.580 --> 00:01:57.620
This is the Shinjuku Division.

00:01:57.620 --> 00:02:01.830
Drawn to the glowing neon and
energy of this city that never sleeps,

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:04.410
love and desire run wild.

00:02:04.410 --> 00:02:08.200
Nationality, sex, race, culture, values,

00:02:08.200 --> 00:02:12.120
in this mishmash of a city,
conventional wisdom does not apply.

00:02:12.120 --> 00:02:16.540
Its people will spawn more
mysterious incidents again today.

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:52.330
"Will you have me to yourself till morning?"

00:03:55.620 --> 00:03:59.660
Everyone! This lovely little kitten
has bought me champagne!

00:03:59.660 --> 00:04:01.450
Hifumi! I'm cheering for you!

00:04:01.450 --> 00:04:03.620
Keep it up, Matenro!

00:04:03.620 --> 00:04:04.790
Thanks, people!

00:04:04.790 --> 00:04:08.410
Shinjuku's in good hands with Matenro!

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:09.450
Yay!

00:04:19.870 --> 00:04:21.700
Sorry, Doppo. Take care of these for me.

00:04:21.700 --> 00:04:23.660
I've got a date this evening.

00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:25.410
Okay...

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:29.000
I've got some plans I can't back out of either.

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:30.620
Okay...

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:36.660
Take care of these too. I... don't really
have any other business to attend to.

00:04:36.660 --> 00:04:38.450
Okay...

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:48.660
Hey, I hear there's gonna be a division battle.

00:04:48.660 --> 00:04:50.830
Matenro's got Shinjuku for sure.

00:04:50.830 --> 00:04:52.580
Jakurai's incredible, isn't he?

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:55.250
I'm more into Hifumi the star host.

00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:58.450
Say, aren't there three guys on that team?

00:04:58.450 --> 00:05:01.040
Who's the third guy again?

00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:02.830
Hey! Watch where you're going, jerk!

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:04.540
Oh, forgive me.

00:05:04.540 --> 00:05:06.580
I'm so sorry.

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:11.660
I wonder if I'll be okay
for the division battle.

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:14.660
I hope I don't drag the rest of the team down.

00:05:20.370 --> 00:05:24.500
Hi, I'm home! But wait, Hifumi's at work...

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:25.290
Huh?

00:05:25.290 --> 00:05:28.200
Hey, Hifumi, you home?

00:05:28.200 --> 00:05:30.540
Why don't you turn the lights on?

00:05:30.540 --> 00:05:31.450
Wait.

00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:32.450
Huh? Who's that?

00:05:32.450 --> 00:05:34.750
That's... not Hifumi...

00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:36.080
Ummm...

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:38.750
And you are?

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:41.040
Huh? What?

00:05:42.080 --> 00:05:43.500
No!

00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:44.830
I-It can't be...

00:05:44.830 --> 00:05:46.000
Uwahhhhh!

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:48.450
He's dead!

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:50.330
P-Police...

00:05:50.330 --> 00:05:52.830
I gotta call the police.

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:55.620
Wait... maybe...

00:05:58.410 --> 00:05:58.750
Hello?

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:01.620
Hifumi?! Did you kill somebody?

00:06:01.620 --> 00:06:04.910
What? What are you talking about?

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:08.620
Well, there's a random dead guy
in our apartment, so I just assumed...

00:06:08.620 --> 00:06:11.580
Haha, very funny.

00:06:11.580 --> 00:06:14.700
Anyhow, I'm on my way over, so just sit tight.

00:06:14.700 --> 00:06:17.660
What? Hello? Hifumi?

00:06:17.660 --> 00:06:23.120
Does this mean I'm all alone with
this dead guy until Hifumi gets here?

00:06:23.120 --> 00:06:27.700
All right. I'll try not to think about anything.

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:31.660
I'm just an animal with a tiny brain.

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:36.040
What has a tiny brain?

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:40.950
A hippo?! No! The creature
can't have a brain at all.

00:06:40.950 --> 00:06:42.950
A creature with no brain.

00:06:42.950 --> 00:06:45.790
Yes... something really tiny!

00:06:45.790 --> 00:06:48.250
A water flea!

00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:50.450
I am... a water flea.

00:06:50.450 --> 00:06:53.910
Yes, a water flea... I'm a water flea.

00:06:53.910 --> 00:06:57.540
Oh, spirit of the water flea...
fill me with your presence.

00:06:57.540 --> 00:07:02.830
Uwahhhhh!

00:07:06.620 --> 00:07:11.120
Doppomine! Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:12.500
Hifumi...

00:07:12.500 --> 00:07:14.330
C'mon.

00:07:14.330 --> 00:07:16.660
--So? Is there really a dead guy in there?

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:17.540
--You idiot!
--So? Is there really a dead guy in there?

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:20.580
What kind of moron says the words
"dead guy" in such a loud voice?

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:23.700
Whoa...

00:07:23.700 --> 00:07:25.410
Doppo, who is he?

00:07:25.410 --> 00:07:27.500
I told you I don't know.

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:31.040
He's got your tie wrapped
around his neck, Doppo.

00:07:31.040 --> 00:07:33.000
So, that's what you used to strangle him.

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:34.950
I'm telling you it wasn't me!

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:37.910
Well then, who did?

00:07:37.910 --> 00:07:39.250
Huh?

00:07:40.790 --> 00:07:42.580
It's the cops.

00:07:42.580 --> 00:07:46.290
Things don't look good, so for now,
let's get the hell outta here, Doppo.

00:07:47.370 --> 00:07:49.120
This is so...

00:07:49.120 --> 00:07:53.080
The texture is the exact opposite
from tearing off a hunk of meat.

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:56.250
Instead of raging meat juices,

00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:58.580
a soothing sweetness melts
and spreads throughout your mouth.

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:01.870
I always thought that
Belgian waffles were the best.

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:04.290
Little did I know that Japan's waffles had
evolved so much...

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:07.410
Apparently in Shinjuku you can
also get fluffy and creamy French toast.

00:08:07.410 --> 00:08:08.660
What the--?!

00:08:08.660 --> 00:08:09.330
Huh?

00:08:09.330 --> 00:08:10.950
Looks like something went down.

00:08:10.950 --> 00:08:12.450
Tom, we've gotta go!

00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:16.790
Iris, I'm a street photographer.

00:08:16.790 --> 00:08:19.040
I cover culture, not the news.

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:20.750
So, I'm gonna stick to "fluffy and creamy" here.

00:08:20.750 --> 00:08:24.660
But a lot of your best work
was taken at times like this.

00:08:24.660 --> 00:08:26.500
B-But what about the fluffy and creamy--

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:29.000
The shop's not going anywhere!

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:31.580
Fluffy and creamy!

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:34.500
Why are the cops here?

00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:37.290
Somebody must've called it in.

00:08:37.290 --> 00:08:40.950
If we'd stayed there, they would've
nabbed you for sure, Doppomine.

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:43.500
That makes it sound like
I'm the one that did it.

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:46.830
But they'll nab you
if we don't make a break for it.

00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:53.790
That's...

00:08:56.120 --> 00:08:59.160
But I don't see a way out of this.

00:08:59.160 --> 00:09:00.450
Oh?

00:09:02.120 --> 00:09:03.700
Huh?!

00:09:03.700 --> 00:09:05.540
Dr. Jakurai!

00:09:05.540 --> 00:09:07.080
C'mon, Doppomine!

00:09:07.080 --> 00:09:08.660
Huh?

00:09:12.450 --> 00:09:16.500
Huh? Hmm...

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:19.200
Oh!

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:22.410
Huh?!

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:27.910
That's Matenro...

00:09:27.910 --> 00:09:29.700
What the hell's going on?

00:09:30.870 --> 00:09:34.450
Hey Doc, perfect timing!
We're so freakin' lucky!

00:09:34.450 --> 00:09:36.290
Why are you here, Doctor?

00:09:36.290 --> 00:09:41.370
I went over to your place because I wanted
to discuss the division battle, but...

00:09:41.370 --> 00:09:43.830
...there were cops all around.

00:09:43.830 --> 00:09:48.120
I had a bad feeling about it,
so I went around back.

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:50.200
What exactly is going on?

00:09:50.200 --> 00:09:52.750
You wouldn't believe what happened.

00:09:52.750 --> 00:09:56.200
When I got home, there was a dead guy there.

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:58.950
He'd been strangled by one of my neckties.

00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:00.120
What did he look like?

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:06.000
Average. Medium height and build.
His face and the suit he was wearing: all average.

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:09.580
He was so freakin' average
I can't remember a thing about him.

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:14.450
There's something mysterious about this.
No, it feels more like a trap.

00:10:14.450 --> 00:10:17.950
You mean someone's trying to frame us?

00:10:17.950 --> 00:10:20.250
We don't have enough information.

00:10:20.250 --> 00:10:23.950
It's time to ask a colleague
who's well-connected.

00:10:23.950 --> 00:10:26.080
"Matenro"

00:10:29.950 --> 00:10:34.580
Well, well. It's not every day
I get a call from you, Doc.

00:10:34.580 --> 00:10:39.870
Something troublesome has happened,
and I was hoping you could help me out.

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:42.040
Do you think he's talking to...

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:45.330
...Samatoki Aohitsugi of the Yokohama Division!

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:49.000
As if I could turn down a request from you, Doc.

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:51.160
I'll call you right back.

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:55.080
You could deploy me, if you like.

00:10:55.080 --> 00:10:58.410
Every time you get involved;
you always go overboard.

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:04.870
"Traffic Safety"

00:11:05.290 --> 00:11:09.250
Oh, I see. I understand the situation.

00:11:09.250 --> 00:11:10.410
I'll get right on it.

00:11:10.410 --> 00:11:16.120
In the Shinjuku Precinct... I've got
two or three guys under my thumb.

00:11:19.080 --> 00:11:19.790
"Matenro"

00:11:20.750 --> 00:11:25.620
It appears that the police are after
Doppo as the prime suspect in the case.

00:11:25.620 --> 00:11:26.790
No way!

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:29.870
They set you up, Doppomine.

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:32.410
Yeah, I have a higher opinion of you now, Doppo.

00:11:32.410 --> 00:11:36.160
I can't believe somebody hates you that much.
I've gotta hand it to you!

00:11:36.160 --> 00:11:39.410
But I never wronged anyone.

00:11:39.410 --> 00:11:44.040
In any case, to clear Doppo's name
it appears we have no choice but

00:11:44.040 --> 00:11:47.370
to find out the truth of the matter ourselves.

00:11:47.370 --> 00:11:51.250
But what are we supposed to do?
Do you have any leads?

00:11:51.250 --> 00:11:56.370
This man appeared on a security camera
before the crime occurred.

00:11:56.370 --> 00:11:58.450
Huh? Wait a sec, that's...

00:11:58.450 --> 00:11:59.660
Do you know him?

00:11:59.660 --> 00:12:04.040
His name's Uwabami.
He used to be a host at my club.

00:12:04.040 --> 00:12:06.160
Even though he wasn't raking in a lot of dough,

00:12:06.160 --> 00:12:08.410
he'd make random passes at the customers

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:10.290
and hang out with the wrong crowd,

00:12:10.290 --> 00:12:12.040
so he got fired.

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:14.370
So, he's the guy who really did it?

00:12:14.370 --> 00:12:17.950
But why would he frame you, Doppomine?

00:12:17.950 --> 00:12:22.410
At any rate, it's highly likely
that he knows something about it.

00:12:22.410 --> 00:12:25.370
Let's ask around at places
he's likely to frequent.

00:12:28.120 --> 00:12:29.500
Are you freakin' serious?!

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:34.290
Some real dangerous dudes
hang out at the places he goes to.

00:12:34.290 --> 00:12:38.620
I see. Fascinating.

00:12:56.200 --> 00:12:58.500
And you are?

00:12:58.500 --> 00:13:01.080
This is a members-only establishment.

00:13:01.080 --> 00:13:03.290
We're looking for someone.

00:13:03.290 --> 00:13:05.790
A man by the name of Uwabami.

00:13:05.790 --> 00:13:09.040
Never heard of him.
I'm afraid I must ask you to leave now.

00:13:09.040 --> 00:13:11.200
Now that just won't do.

00:13:11.200 --> 00:13:13.870
We didn't come here on
some fool's errand, you realize.

00:13:13.870 --> 00:13:17.750
In that case, I guess
we'll have to remove you by force.

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:20.830
I knew it would come to this...

00:13:20.830 --> 00:13:24.660
Well then, we'll play by your rules!

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:33.830
All right, let's go to
the next place on the list.

00:13:48.200 --> 00:13:52.540
I-I-I don't know shit!
Uwabami hasn't been here, I swear!

00:13:52.540 --> 00:13:56.830
I'll be sure to give him your message.
Now would you let me off the hook?

00:13:57.660 --> 00:13:59.910
It appears you're telling the truth.

00:14:01.450 --> 00:14:03.870
All right, please relay my message.

00:14:06.160 --> 00:14:12.000
Everybody freeze! Hands on the floor...
Face down... Huh?!

00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:13.500
Not again.

00:14:13.500 --> 00:14:18.160
What's this? These guys
are all wanted criminals too.

00:14:18.160 --> 00:14:20.540
It's the third time this has happened tonight.

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:25.040
People are saying they saw Jakurai.
Is this his team's handiwork?

00:14:25.040 --> 00:14:28.620
If it is, the good doctor's
solving too many cases...

00:14:30.410 --> 00:14:34.580
Hifumi, Doppo, thanks to you,

00:14:34.580 --> 00:14:38.040
we managed to drive out some of
the rampant corruption plaguing Shinjuku.

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:39.950
Oh, really?

00:14:39.950 --> 00:14:44.620
The hospital receives various
posters of wanted criminals, you see.

00:14:44.620 --> 00:14:48.120
I estimate roughly ten of the guys
we defeated tonight appeared on them.

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:52.660
Freakin' awesome! We really did
Shinjuku a favor now, didn't we?

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:53.910
Great job, Doppomine!

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:57.660
Great job, my ass! That wasn't our objective!

00:14:57.660 --> 00:14:59.410
So what if we clobbered some wanted criminals!

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:02.370
It doesn't matter if we can't find Uwabami,
the key to this whole mystery!

00:15:02.370 --> 00:15:04.000
Yeah, I see your point.

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:07.540
Argh! At this rate, my name'll be put
on the wanted list, and they'll arrest me...

00:15:07.540 --> 00:15:09.700
It's actually not so easy to become
someone who's wanted by name.

00:15:09.700 --> 00:15:11.950
Oh, will you shut up?

00:15:11.950 --> 00:15:17.500
You can rest easy, Doppo.
The man we're looking for will be here shortly.

00:15:17.500 --> 00:15:18.500
Huh?

00:15:18.500 --> 00:15:20.870
Doctor, did you find Uwabami?

00:15:20.870 --> 00:15:24.290
I left a message for him
at the last place we visited.

00:15:24.290 --> 00:15:27.330
Seeing as we crushed so many of his associates,

00:15:27.330 --> 00:15:31.620
he will surely come here,
beside himself with rage.

00:15:31.620 --> 00:15:32.700
It appears someone is here now.

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:34.450
Huh?!

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:37.830
Hifumi!

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:39.500
A-A girl?!

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:43.290
Oh? Somehow, you don't seem
like your usual self, Hifumi...

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:45.700
Here you go, Hifumi.

00:15:47.330 --> 00:15:48.580
Hifumi?

00:15:48.580 --> 00:15:50.250
Oh, it's you, Mimimi!

00:15:50.250 --> 00:15:52.000
What? You know her?

00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:56.410
Yeah, Mimimi's a customer at my host club.

00:15:56.410 --> 00:16:02.200
I'm so sorry, Hifumi!
I didn't mean to cause you any trouble.

00:16:02.200 --> 00:16:03.580
What are you talking about?

00:16:03.580 --> 00:16:07.620
I love you so very very much, Hifumi.

00:16:07.620 --> 00:16:12.290
That's why I couldn't stand
that bastard who lives with you.

00:16:12.290 --> 00:16:13.120
Who, me?!

00:16:13.120 --> 00:16:18.700
Uh-huh. You look as dumb as a hippo
and have the presence of a water flea.

00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:23.160
I thought that if I could get rid of you,
I could have Hifumi all to myself!

00:16:23.160 --> 00:16:27.120
You belong to me, Hifumi! And I belong to you!

00:16:27.120 --> 00:16:31.790
I see. Mimimi was madly in love with Hifumi.

00:16:31.790 --> 00:16:33.410
So that's what led to the crime.

00:16:33.410 --> 00:16:37.700
Huh? Hold on a sec! So that means
I was just dragged into all this?

00:16:37.700 --> 00:16:40.790
But how were you able to get into our apartment?

00:16:40.790 --> 00:16:43.250
I have the key to your room, silly.

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:49.580
Along with the keys to Hifumi's club,
his locker, his car, and his gym locker!

00:16:49.580 --> 00:16:52.700
This girl's seriously deranged!

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:56.200
But Mimimi, you were never my customer.

00:16:56.200 --> 00:17:00.830
That's because... I loved you so much,
Hifumi, I couldn't ask for you by name...

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:04.080
Wasn't your host...

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:04.950
...Uwabami?!

00:17:04.950 --> 00:17:09.580
That's right. I used Uwabami
to commit the crime.

00:17:09.580 --> 00:17:13.040
Hehehehe! That's how it is!

00:17:13.040 --> 00:17:13.910
Hmm?

00:17:13.910 --> 00:17:14.500
Huh?!

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:17.750
Mimimi's my girl now!

00:17:17.750 --> 00:17:20.620
Um... So, you two are seeing each other?

00:17:20.620 --> 00:17:23.250
Yeah, but my heart belongs to Hifumi!

00:17:23.250 --> 00:17:26.700
Hifumi, I never did like you much!

00:17:26.700 --> 00:17:30.660
Now you're a murderer! Game over, man!

00:17:30.660 --> 00:17:34.080
Huh? Um... The police
suspect me of the crime...

00:17:34.080 --> 00:17:37.580
What do you mean? I used Hifumi's necktie...

00:17:37.580 --> 00:17:40.080
No, that was the pesky water flea's necktie.

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:43.120
Hey! That means Hifumi won't get blamed for it!

00:17:43.120 --> 00:17:46.080
But the water flea was the one
who was getting in my way!

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:48.620
Now they've turned me into a water flea...

00:17:48.620 --> 00:17:50.870
Wait a sec! So, who the hell's the dead guy?!

00:17:50.870 --> 00:17:53.000
Mimimi's husband!

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:57.660
Once I got him out of the way,
Mimimi would be mine through and through!

00:17:57.660 --> 00:17:59.120
So, there was a husband too?!

00:17:59.120 --> 00:18:02.120
Yeah, but my heart belongs to Hifumi!

00:18:02.120 --> 00:18:05.290
C'mon, hurry up and swat that pesky water flea.

00:18:05.290 --> 00:18:10.500
Sure, I'll crush the water flea
along with the rest of them.

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:13.580
Grrr... Who do you think
you're calling a water flea?

00:18:13.580 --> 00:18:17.040
All you bastards calling me
whatever you damn well please...

00:18:17.040 --> 00:18:20.080
Nothing but overtime day after day after day.

00:18:20.080 --> 00:18:24.660
A date? Plans you can't back out of?
And Comb-Over doesn't even have an excuse?

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:27.500
What the hell did I do to deserve this?

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:30.250
Arghhhhh!

00:18:31.620 --> 00:18:34.870
I'll teach you to drag an innocent
bystander like me into your schemes!

00:18:34.870 --> 00:18:36.370
Sorry about this, Doppo!

00:18:36.370 --> 00:18:38.450
We'll take you on!

00:18:54.040 --> 00:18:58.370
Hey... you know what,
I don't know where I should go...

00:19:00.500 --> 00:19:01.700
♬ Nanana-nana ♬

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:02.750
♬ Where are we? ♬

00:19:02.750 --> 00:19:03.830
♬ Nanana-nana ♬

00:19:03.830 --> 00:19:05.080
♬ Let's go! Party Night! ♬

00:19:05.080 --> 00:19:06.160
♬ Nanana-nana ♬

00:19:06.160 --> 00:19:09.450
♬ City of Pandora, where common sense is useless ♬

00:19:09.450 --> 00:19:11.750
♬ Shinjuku... working overtime again, ♬

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:13.950
♬ burning the midnight oil,
gotta wrap this up tonight ♬

00:19:13.950 --> 00:19:16.200
♬ This is Matenro's pride! That was rude of me! ♬

00:19:16.200 --> 00:19:18.200
♬ So sorry... but this water flea's got a bite (lol) ♬

00:19:18.200 --> 00:19:20.620
♬ Wh-Wh-What happened?
What's up, my friend Doppo? ♬

00:19:20.620 --> 00:19:22.950
♬ Unforgivable, who hurt you?! (C'mon) ♬

00:19:22.950 --> 00:19:27.250
♬ For all my lost kittens, I'll give you (yeah)...
the power of love! ♬

00:19:27.250 --> 00:19:31.910
♬ Indeed, information overflowing endlessly,
a baseless uproar unnecessarily ♬

00:19:31.910 --> 00:19:36.370
♬ In the shadows of the neon lights lie deception,
violence, all manner of vice ♬

00:19:36.370 --> 00:19:40.620
♬ An era that was nullified, that's why...
let sleeping dogs lie ♬

00:19:40.620 --> 00:19:42.870
♬ We'll have to keep fighting you know ♬

00:19:42.870 --> 00:19:45.290
♬ Perfect! This will show the power of Matenro! ♬

00:19:45.290 --> 00:19:46.580
♬ All year round ♬

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:47.750
♬ Let's have a party ♬

00:19:47.750 --> 00:19:48.580
♬ A challenge ♬

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:49.910
♬ Battle tonight! ♬

00:19:49.910 --> 00:19:50.790
♬ I'll take you on ♬

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:54.370
♬ Jump around! Jump around!
It's Matenro, everybody ♬

00:19:54.370 --> 00:19:55.580
♬ The time has come ♬

00:19:55.580 --> 00:19:56.580
♬ Burn your spirit ♬

00:19:56.580 --> 00:19:57.450
♬ Black or white ♬

00:19:57.450 --> 00:19:58.750
♬ All of Shinjuku ♬

00:19:58.750 --> 00:20:00.160
♬ Let's decide ♬

00:20:00.160 --> 00:20:04.330
♬ Are you ready? We're the true leader, Matenro! ♬

00:20:22.750 --> 00:20:25.790
Here's a voice recorder that contains
the suspects' taped confession.

00:20:25.790 --> 00:20:28.830
This should clear Doppo of all charges.

00:20:28.830 --> 00:20:32.910
Yes, the attempted murder case
has now been resolved.

00:20:32.910 --> 00:20:36.910
That's wonderful!
Wait, what? Attempted murder?

00:20:36.910 --> 00:20:40.580
The man found in your apartment has come to.

00:20:40.580 --> 00:20:42.250
Isn't that great news, Doppo?

00:20:42.250 --> 00:20:44.910
It was your fault to begin with!

00:20:44.910 --> 00:20:48.540
I'll let you off the hook
this time, Dr. Jakurai,

00:20:48.540 --> 00:20:51.660
but one of these days I'll trip you up.

00:20:51.660 --> 00:20:53.500
Ahem.

00:20:59.410 --> 00:21:03.750
My heart belongs to you, Hifumi!

00:21:03.750 --> 00:21:05.620
Mimimi...

00:21:05.620 --> 00:21:07.750
Reflect on what you did.

00:21:07.750 --> 00:21:12.000
When it comes down to it,
love is caring for the other person.

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:17.160
Only those who expect nothing in return
can know the true meaning of love.

00:21:17.160 --> 00:21:19.120
Hifumi...

00:21:19.120 --> 00:21:23.620
I kind of know how you feel.
Wanting to feel appreciated by someone.

00:21:23.620 --> 00:21:27.370
I'm just a wispy water flea
who's an overtime machine.

00:21:27.370 --> 00:21:31.580
But even water fleas
are doing their best to survive.

00:21:31.580 --> 00:21:35.910
You've been through a lot, haven't you?

00:21:37.500 --> 00:21:41.660
It appears your sincere words
have reached her, you two.

00:21:43.540 --> 00:21:45.870
I declare this case closed.

