"Comments:
MISACHII@HIFUMINFAN (3 Hours Ago)
Who's this? Some office worker??"

00:21:55.620 --> 00:21:57.910
See? Lookin' cool, Doppomine!

00:21:58.040 --> 00:22:01.830
It's a close-up of me...

00:22:01.830 --> 00:22:02.540
Ah, but everyone's like, "Who's this guy?"

00:22:02.540 --> 00:22:05.200
"MISACHII@HIFUMINFAN (3 Hours Ago)
Who's this? Some office worker??"
"MOMO (3 Hours Ago)  Was this guy in the group?"

00:22:02.540 --> 00:22:05.200
Ah, but everyone's like, "Who's this guy?"

00:22:05.500 --> 00:22:06.250
Oh!

00:22:06.250 --> 00:22:07.620
Well, I'm just a...

00:22:07.620 --> 00:22:12.540
No, there's gotta be somebody out there
who understands your appeal, Doppomine!

00:22:12.540 --> 00:22:15.750
One of these days,
I'll find what's good about you, Doppo.

00:22:15.750 --> 00:22:20.580
Hmmm, what's good about Doppo...
What's good about Doppo...
